WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:02.560 line:0%
-Phoebe, hey.
-Hey.

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:06.240 position:63% line:0%
Hey, look,
I was wondering if maybe you wanted to--

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:08.120 line:0%
to hang out.

00:00:10.872 --> 00:00:12.873 line:0%
It's the last summer
after high school ends.

00:00:13.561 --> 00:00:15.872 position:64% line:0%
The last chance to decide who we wanna be

00:00:16.761 --> 00:00:17.792 line:0%
and who we wanna be with.

00:00:18.682 --> 00:00:20.955 line:0%
I give up. What are you supposed
to wear to a breakup?

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:23.560 line:0%
How about we agree to stay friends?

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:24.473 line:0%
Just friends.

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:25.800 line:0%
Okay. Walk away.

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:29.072 line:0%
For God sakes.

00:00:32.722 --> 00:00:34.432 line:0%
This is gonna be the summer.
Just clean the slate.

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:37.960 line:0%
You're really good.

00:00:38.042 --> 00:00:40.395 position:61% line:0%
I can't believe you're wasting all this
to study business.

00:00:40.458 --> 00:00:43.081 position:61% line:0%
Right?
Over a safe, stable career in the arts.

00:00:44.915 --> 00:00:47.191 line:0%
Hi, boys! Beach bonfire party.
Are you down?

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:49.360 line:0%
Sure, yeah.

00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:55.870 position:61% line:0%
Come on,
I'm not actually gonna go out with him.

00:00:56.482 --> 00:00:59.357 position:64% line:0%
No. He's young, successful, and he's hot.

00:00:59.458 --> 00:01:00.312 line:0%
Gross.

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:04.960 position:63% line:0%
So, what's the deal with you and Phoebs?

00:01:05.207 --> 00:01:07.479 line:0%
-We haven't talked about it yet.
-Keeping the mystery alive.

00:01:07.583 --> 00:01:08.550 line:0%
I dig it, man.

00:01:10.202 --> 00:01:14.150 line:0%
Sometimes I fear
whether I'm even capable of love.

00:01:15.673 --> 00:01:16.991 line:0%
Welcome to my office.

00:01:17.802 --> 00:01:19.870 position:63% line:0%
You're making it very hard to judge you.

00:01:21.922 --> 00:01:23.993 position:63% line:0%
The summer's just going by way too fast.

00:01:24.083 --> 00:01:25.990 line:0%
I wanted to see you
before we both leave for school.

00:01:26.777 --> 00:01:28.604 line:0%
-Hey.
-I gotta go.

00:01:28.680 --> 00:01:30.670 line:0%
But have a nice Fourth, okay?

00:01:32.353 --> 00:01:33.829 position:58% line:0%
Phoebe,
there's something I need to tell you.

00:01:35.163 --> 00:01:36.633 position:63% line:0%
You just went along and you did nothing.

00:01:36.876 --> 00:01:39.413 position:56% line:0%
I didn't know what to do.
I've never been through this before.

00:01:53.645 --> 00:01:54.628 line:0%
One last summer.

00:01:56.471 --> 00:01:58.270 line:0%
The last chance to go all in.

00:01:59.962 --> 00:02:01.268 position:56% line:0%
I mean, what's there to lose, right?

